{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24202","headline":"送刘五司马赴任硖州兼寄崔使君 · 白居易","name":"送刘五司马赴任硖州兼寄崔使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"位下才高多怨天，刘兄道胜独恬然。\n贫於扬子两三倍，老过荣公六七年。\n笔砚莫抛留压案，箪瓢从陋也销钱。\n郡丞自合当优礼，何况夷陵太守贤。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}